t's awesome to find something that makes us happy. It's fulfilling and motivating too. I'm so glad we're on this journey together and curious to see what happens next!\n[S26T11] (dia_id: D26:11)\n\nDave: Me too, Calvin! Let's see where it takes us. We can keep inspiring each other!\n[S26T12] (dia_id: D26:12)\n\nCalvin: Yep, let's keep inspiring each other to be our best selves. Keep going for your passion, buddy.\n[S26T13] (dia_id: D26:13)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! Same to you! Keep pursuing your passion and keep dreaming. We got this! Got to go see you soon!\n[S26T14] (dia_id: D26:14)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! I appreciate your support. Let's keep pushing for our goals. Catch you later, see ya!\n[S26T15] (dia_id: D26:15)","text_sha256":"6809228d52a7e9011d6ecf236fc0a560fd12c2d3ae73a3f8422cc14fc30263cf","timestamp":"2023-10-25T20:25:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","pre_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":921,"filesystem_tool_calls":0,"model_calls":4,"orchestration_calls":4,"prompt_tokens":17738,"provider_request_attempts":4,"provider_rounds":4,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":18659},"model":{"requested_model":"coding","served_models":["qwen3.8:27b"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"6930d93099ac20b76e881b68cbb63b46e1a0a3e2ff43453db685551c3339a6dc","filesystem_tools_sha256":"98017e74a12c2eec4f0139c484d2d6bd809e4f37a8f96c7f419dc9591563dbfa","orchestration_actions_sha256":"3fa6b1160c2f7f9b2a8b3e232721d4ca78a161abb31af0d4f1f2e307b7354581","paper_prompt_id":"refind-appendix-a-stage1-plus-temporal-normalized-v1","paper_prompt_sha256":"20422063cc471ee1de75c38e4250e1a141a731ea2970786a6c715dc3c83cf7de"},"protocol_version":"shared-evidence-bundle-v1","question":{"conversation_id":"conv-50","question":"Where was Calvin located in the last week of October 2023?","question_id